<title>POLAND: Polish 98 budget gap hard to finance at 97 levels.</title>
<headline>Polish 98 budget gap hard to finance at 97 levels.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-05-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish Finance Minister Marek Belka on Wednesday said that next year's budget deficit would be difficult to finance if it remained at the 1997 planned level of 2.8 percent of the gross domestic product (GDP).</p>
</text>
